This project is inspired by and incorporates architectural concepts from
OpenAI Symphony (https://github.com/openai/symphony),
Copyright (c) OpenAI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically, the following architectural paradigms and patterns draw inspiration
from the OpenAI Symphony specification (SPEC.md):
- Single-flight issue claiming and lock protocol
- Reader/Writer routine separation (Autowork vs. Peer Review)
- Warm-context review and interactive fix loops
- Dead-run claim recovery and stale claim eviction
- Dynamic repository-agnostic prompt ingestion from AGENTS.md
